EXAMPLE 5 — Stripe-scale payment processing:
erDiagram
    ACCOUNTS ||--o{ API_KEYS : owns
    ACCOUNTS ||--o{ CUSTOMERS : has
    ACCOUNTS ||--o{ PRODUCTS : catalogs
    PRODUCTS ||--o{ PRICES : priced_as
    CUSTOMERS ||--o{ PAYMENT_METHODS : owns
    CUSTOMERS ||--o{ PAYMENT_INTENTS : initiates
